WEBVTT

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.990
A girl was run over!

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.610
Someone call an ambulance!

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.070
Poor thing.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.870
She wasn't a Root.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.830
What do you mean?

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.170
What do you mean "Root?"

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.960
That's the fate of humans.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.880
Mayu!

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:40.600
Hey, what are you...

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:51.570
The world has started to show me that it's different from what I thought it was.

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:04.290
We are Tribal Ends,

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:08.790
who were given the Tera of the strongest clan among the Mototsumitama, the Shishigami.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.960
For you to be defeated by a mere stray Mototsumitama in a fight is...

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.800
She didn't even use Exceed.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:22.310
Starting to feel numb, right?

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:27.310
P-Plus, she said that she wants to kill Hiyou-sama!

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.560
What's so great about Hiyou?

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:33.190
Are you saying that you prioritize Hiyou's orders over mine?

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:35.070
B-But Seiji-san...

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:45.540
You piece of trash.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.830
Find that girl.

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.670
I'll hand her over to Hiyou after I consume her Tera.

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:59.970
"Contract"

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.100
I saw a girl who looks exactly like me this morning.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:14.400
It's true that, including yourself, there are three people in the world who look the same.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:32.250
They both died after seeing someone who looked like them.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.500
It's the same as what happened to Mom.

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:04.780
Keita-kun...

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.000
[It's Akane. Good morning! Today's breakfast is fried hot dogs. Cheer up. ^_^]

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.830
The trauma left behind from auntie Maki's death...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.660
I hope he isn't reminded of that.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:22.430
The number of K-ON Marts in the various cities and prefectures has reached 100.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.430
In the Meihan area, not only are the number of directly-managed stores increasing,

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:27.560
but the number of franchises as well.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.140
We will be opening our first store in Okinawa tomorrow. The other...

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:46.330
Midterm exams will start next week.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.540
I hope you will concentrate on them.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:55.960
There are three copies of the same person in the world, but their luck differs.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.130
If the Subs were to encounter each other, based on the established rules,

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:02.970
they would be annihilated by sickness, accidents, or other reasons.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:11.600
She even said that was the fate of humans. What on earth is she?

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:17.400
What's wrong? Depressed over what happened to Yamada?

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.230
No, not really.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.570
You look pale, though.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:25.360
You've been late more often recently too.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.240
I'm sorry.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.410
You're living by yourself, too.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:31.750
Though I don't look it, I'm actually quite worried about you.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.290
Tell me if something is bothering you.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.920
Nah, it's just something stupid.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:39.840
What is it?

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:41.510
Tell me.

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.510
Have you heard of Doppeliners?

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:54.350
I-It's nothing. It's just a rumor I heard.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.350
A rumor? From the class?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.980
No, I heard it from a strange girl on the street.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.150
Is she trying to solicit you into doing something suspicious?

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:04.820
Be careful. It's nothing more than an urban legend.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:05.780
Don't worry about it.

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:13.540
An urban legend, huh?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.290
I knew he wouldn't believe me.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:23.300
I don't want to be involved in any more weird incidents, either.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.600
Akane-san?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.520
Did she go shopping?

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.690
I'm always telling her to switch off the lights.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.160
Who's there? What are you doing?

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:57.330
Welcome back. Sorry for intruding.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.750
I wasn't suppose to eat this cabbage?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:06.340
Sorry, I was too hungry.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.340
What are you doing here?!

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:14.970
It seems that Punipuni remembered your scent.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:15.850
My scent?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.230
Ramen...

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.600
Hamburger...

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.600
Bibimbap...

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.360
Shish Kebabs...

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.280
At that moment, a woman saved me.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.490
I'm back.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.990
Ah, my savior!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.830
Akane-san, why did you let her in?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.870
I couldn't leave her alone, right?

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:43.500
She collapsed, and she seems to be someone you know.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:47.380
Wait a bit. I'll cook up something right away.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.550
I bought you some onigiri. Eat them first.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.180
Thank you so much!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:55.890
She's so nice and pretty.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:58.100
Oh my, I'm not that great.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.140
I'm envious that you have such a pretty sister.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.900
I'm not his sister.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:05.900
Then, his aunt?

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.440
E-Erm...

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:08.650
Get out.

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:14.830
I don't want to get involved with someone like you.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.410
Keita-kun...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.420
Sorry.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.130
Sorry for being a nuisance.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:30.420
Wait!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.550
It's okay, Akane-san.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.850
I thought you knew her.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:38.060
She even said that you treated her to ramen.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:41.350
Akane-san, just go home.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.860
Sorry, I already ate out.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:29.770
Roger.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:34.610
Hiyou-sama wants us to capture the girl who was spotted loitering around here.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.200
I'll catch her before he does.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.120
I can smell it...

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:48.340
The scent of a Mototsumitama that's unpolluted by the city air, a fresh and vigorous energy.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.300
Onigiri are so tasty!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.970
They have different ingredients in them.

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.970
It's sour!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.100
Here.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.310
Thanks a lot.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.270
Who are you?

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.940
I'm called Kuro. Didn't I tell you that before?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.270
Not that.

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:16.150
Why do you know about things like Doppeliners and Roots?

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.950
Because I'm a Mototsumitama.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.950
That's what I'm asking about!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:24.000
Mototsumitama exist to control the balance of coexistence.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.250
Balance of coexistence?

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:31.250
All beings in this world receive an equal amount of Tera.

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:36.300
However, due to fate, a person's soul is divided into three.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.760
If their Tera... To put it simply, if their total luck is 100,

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.600
that total will be divided among the three of them who share the same face.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:49.100
If they were to meet, the two with the lower Tera will be eliminated by the power of the system.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:54.360
The remaining one would absorb all the luck and become a Master Root.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.280
That's the Doppeliner system in a nutshell.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:02.030
Your Doppeliner definitely exists somewhere, too.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.700
It's just that you haven't met him.

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:06.750
Impossible.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.040
This is just...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:14.460
But it's true that they all died.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.840
Doppeliners.

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:19.550
What an interesting system.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:25.060
Only the one with good luck is able to attain happiness.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.060
They may have the ability to change the world, too.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.900
My, my... I really am lucky.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.660
Do you want to delete this document?

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.660
Yes
No

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:43.910
Deleting.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.870
Deleted.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.370
I'll be heading off, then.

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:50.370
Hey!

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.210
Yes?

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.300
Where are you going?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.800
To kill my brother.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:04.220
Uh... You're called Keita-san, right?

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:07.350
Thanks a lot.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.230
Give my regards to that lady, too.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.020
You are...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.860
He was defeated by a girl like her?

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:25.370
A Tribal End who was given the power of the Shishigami clan?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.240
The Shishigami clan...

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:31.040
But I do smell the scent of high-grade Tera.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.750
It makes me excited.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:36.630
I've killed four Mototsumitama so far.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.670
Let me consume your Tera.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.760
Four... Why are you doing this?

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.890
I'm just aiming at a higher place,

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:50.270
toward a place where stray Mototsumitama can't reach.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.600
You're killing Mototsumitama for a reason like that...

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.520
Unforgivable!

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:17.000
That Tera is making me feel numb.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.210
You're not a normal Mototsumitama, are you?

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:25.220
You are perfect for my opponent.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.980
I shall numb both your body and soul.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.060
Take this!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.240
This technique...

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.780
Yes, it's Exceed.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.740
Surprised?

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:50.740
Why is a Tribal End like you able to use Exceed?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:56.370
Because I consumed the high-grade Tera of the Mototsumitama I defeated.

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:01.380
And not just that... Have a taste of this!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:02.380
It vanished!

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.310
You will be my fifth.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:16.100
Fall prey to this invisible Exceed!

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.270
What's wrong?

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.530
More, more!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:25.450
Numb me even more!

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:39.920
I thought you'd put up a better fight.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:46.420
I can't see his attack, even though I can hear it.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.100
Well then, I'll consume your Tera.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:00.440
Hello, this is the police...

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.400
What are you trying to do?

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.330
That pissed me off.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.520
Mom...

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.570
I'm going to... join you now...

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.780
You should have kept quiet and ran away.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.740
Nothing but a powerless fool.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.180
There's no other way.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.580
That girl...

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.500
What?

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.390
Keita-san,

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.230
please accept this!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.230
Oh, yeah!

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.350
It's okay now.

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:51.440
Your wound has healed. It shouldn't hurt now.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.200
There's so much blood... W-What is this?

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.740
Well, that is...

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.120
I see.

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:04.750
You formed a contract with him to save his life.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:06.330
Contract?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.540
What is this "contact?"

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:10.840
Hey!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:14.630
She saved me?

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:19.890
Dumbass. A contract like that will only drag you down!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.950
What's wrong?

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.820
Looks like you can't synchro right off the bat.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:51.500
I saw something twirling around, and...

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.500
The sounds of wind...

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:56.630
The way the technique is started...

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.010
It's...

00:17:59.220 --> 00:17:59.930
A whip.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:13.020
Do you think you'll win if you turn the fight into melee combat?

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:14.940
How foolish.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.910
Now, Mototsumitama, you are unable to use neither your hands nor your legs.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.410
I shall pierce you with my Exceed.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.870
It's time for the most numbing moment.

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.130
Enough.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:42.510
Even for a Mototsumitama, it's pretty amazing that you survived all my attacks so far.

00:18:43.050 --> 00:18:44.100
However...

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.350
That's enough.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:47.640
Stop it!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:57.030
Ready? I'm going to skewer you!

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:02.160
You like numbness, right?

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:05.160
Then, Kuro will numb you!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.810
Kuro!

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:49.290
I won...

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.670
She...

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.840
She saved my life.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:00.800
However, from that night on,

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:06.970
I was contracted to a fate that I couldn't run away from, even if I wanted to.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:10.270
This is the first frame of the ED

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:28.490
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:28.490
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:39.920
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:39.920
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:52.230
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:52.230
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:20:52.230 --> 00:21:08.700
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:20:52.230 --> 00:21:08.700
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.540
It's as we thought.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:22.960
There's an abnormal amount of Tera gathering in Tokyo.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.510
It's obvious that this is unnatural.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.810
It's as if someone is purposely twisting the flow of the Doppeliners there.

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:35.890
The balance between coexistence is badly disrupted.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:41.770
"Synchro"

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.900
We must fix this.
